flowchart TD
UserInputs["**Input Variables**<br/>Buffer capacities for all buffers
Discrete values {1-10}"]
Objectives["**MOO Objectives**<br/>Minimize WIP
Maximize Throughput"]
MainScript["**Main Script**<br/>Entrypoint run in __main__
Calls Optimization Controller and Exporter"]
OptimizationController["**Optimization Controller**<br/>Orchestrates MOO run
Method run_nsga2_optimization pop_size n_gen n_replications base_seed n_cores"]
BufferCapacityProblem["**Buffer Capacity Problem**<br/>Class BufferCapacityProblem
Attributes n_var n_obj xl xu n_replications base_seed n_cores
Method _evaluate receives population X and returns objective matrix F"]
ParallelExecutor["**Parallel Executor**<br/>Uses multiprocessing Pool
Spawns evaluation tasks across n_cores"]
EvaluateWorker["**Evaluation Worker**<br/>Function evaluate_single_individual
Inputs candidate capacities caps seed n_replications
Calls run_simulation_moo and aggregates reps"]
RunSimulationMOO["**Simulation Runner**<br/>Function run_simulation_moo seed caps warmup measure_until
Builds simulation with given buffer capacities
Returns metrics overall throughput and wip and machine energy"]
SimulationEngine["**Simulation Engine**<br/>Components of the production model
Method run_simulation (original) and used by run_simulation_moo"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity
Methods run breakdown cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption reset"]
DelayBufferClass["**Delay Buffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay store tokens in_transit
Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Config sampling crossover mutation
Operates on Problem instance and population
Returns Pareto front and history"]
ResultsExporter["**Results Exporter**<br/>Function export_history_to_csv
Inputs result history filename
Writes generation records including capacities wip throughput to CSV"]
UserInputs --> OptimizationController
Objectives --> OptimizationController
MainScript --> OptimizationController
OptimizationController --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> ParallelExecutor
ParallelExecutor --> EvaluateWorker
EvaluateWorker --> RunSimulationMOO
RunSimulationMOO --> SimulationEngine
SimulationEngine --> MachineClass
SimulationEngine --> DelayBufferClass
EvaluateWorker --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> OptimizationController
OptimizationController --> ResultsExporter
MainScript --> ResultsExporter